sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Admitted VM handoff
    participant N as netd control
    participant S as Orphan sweep
    participant K as Private kernel route table
    Note over N,S: A previous route for this IP has an old orphan age
    M->>N: Forward this NIC address to the peer node
    N->>N: Acquire retirement lock and clear prior age
    N->>K: Install / replace the forwarding route
    K-->>N: Kernel outcome
    N->>N: Release retirement lock
    S->>S: Acquire same lock for route cleanup
    S->>S: No inherited age, start the new orphan grace
    Note over S,K: A stale inventory cannot retire the fresh route immediately
    S->>K: Retire later after its own unheld grace expires
